<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks fell, four rose and six were flat in 13.6-million-zloty continuous trade on Friday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,605.4 points, 1.2 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining seven stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat at 147.5 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
